# Root build context (used by the nginx image, whose context is the project
# root — see nginx/Dockerfile). The nginx build npm-installs and vite-builds
# the frontend itself, so local deps/artifacts must NOT be shipped in the
# context: they bloat it (~200 MB) and a stale dist hash can break the
# transfer ("invalid file request"). frontend/.dockerignore is NOT consulted
# for the root context, hence this file.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
# Local env / secrets — never needed to build the frontend bundle
**/.env
**/.env.*
# Stray local files that don't belong in any image
frontend/s1-drop.png
zz2.json
